&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="【世界盃2026】日本惡鬥巴西" data-link="" data-src="https://static06.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4150000/4153831/afp_b8pb3rz_1_600.jpg" src="https://static06.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4150000/4153831/afp_b8pb3rz_1_600.jpg" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
